      "side": 1,
      "message": "The whole point of adding engine-strict\u003dtrue to .npmrc is to catch installs on the wrong Node. Silently passing --engine-strict\u003dfalse in format-code.sh means the same CI job that runs linting never actually validates the engine constraint. \nThe CI should also run with the pinned version to avoid mismatch and failures",
